      <t:profileDesc xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
         <t:abstract>
            <t:p>A type of qǝne composed of two strophes, the total consisting of
               seven or eleven verses, sung during the Communion. This is a general record, to be used when 
               the qǝne type is known but the text is inaccessible.</t:p>
         </t:abstract>
